---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: is-splash
---
{# Splash: three big links in Segmentor. Desktop: one line (Projects left,
   Type centred, About right); phones: stacked, each as wide as the screen.
   They follow the mouse (desktop) or the tilt of the phone (script.js §1)
   and get underlined on hover / tap. Behind them loops the background
   video: script.js §2 picks the landscape or the portrait file. The
   addresses use `| url` because the base plugin does not touch data-*. #}
<video class="splash-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-hidden="true"
  data-landscape="{{ '/media/bg-desktop.mp4' | url }}" data-landscape-poster="{{ '/media/bg-desktop-poster.jpg' | url }}"
  data-portrait="{{ '/media/bg-mobile.mp4' | url }}" data-portrait-poster="{{ '/media/bg-mobile-poster.jpg' | url }}"></video>

<nav class="splash-menu" aria-label="Main">
  <ul class="plain-list">
    {% for n in nav %}<li><a class="seg" href="{{ n.url }}">{{ n.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</nav>
